# Google sign-in (optional). Create an OAuth client of type "Web application" at
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and add your site origins
# (e.g. http://localhost:5173 and your production URL) under "Authorized JavaScript origins".
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Without it the Google button shows a setup hint; the demo path still works.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
